  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Eid for All</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The &quot;Eid for All&quot; project is dedicated to ensuring an inclusive celebration of Eid Al Adha for displaced individuals residing in Beqaa, Lebanon. By emphasizing the values of inclusivity, empathy, and compassion, this project aims to create a sense of unity and joy during the festive season and ensures that poor families have access to nutritious food and can experience the spiritual significance of the occasion.</narrative>
  </description>
